Z||000000||Haze_Performance||05-11-2001||02:33 AM||||I'm looking for someone that has reservations in the main building & has a view of the lot. (where the Fieros will be parked during the show) I want to take some show pictures but my room has a water view.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>Can anyone help?<P>TIA  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><I>Haze</I><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">      </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><I>If you want to add your Fiero to the collection, post or send me a photo. (Sent photos ONLY to: purplehazeracing@yahoo.com )</I><P><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||10
Z||000001||RossT||05-11-2001||02:43 AM||||Haze, I have just that view!! Your welcome to take the shots.  But, My room is on the 2ng or 3rd floor with balcony.  You will get a better shot higher up, but then you have to shoot thru glass (no balcony that high up)<BR>If you look thru Cliff's photo page you will see some dells run pics taken from my hotel room last year.  They are from the 5th floor taken thru the glass.  This year I will have a balcony, but much lower.  Your welcome to try.  If you have a wide angle lens, it would help.<P>btw, do you have kids? how old?<P>Ross<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 05-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||RossT||05-11-2001||02:56 AM||||Here is that view from 5 floors up!!<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002490.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002490.html</A> <P>Thats my white minivan conversion in Old Lars's pic...<P>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 05-11-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by RossT (edited 05-11-2001).]||||reg||1
